{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a detective in the Cyber Wild West</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just arrived in Red Hook, a high-tech frontier town hiding a dark secret. The town treasury has been stolen, the sheriff has disappeared, and suspicion is everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task? Launch a full-scale investigation. Search for hidden objects, uncover clues, question locals, and follow the trail wherever it leads. With every twist, the mystery grows more complex, and nothing is quite as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world where futuristic tech collides with old-west charm. Meet eccentric townsfolk, outsmart rival investigators, confront a notorious gang, and cross paths with a mysterious femme fatale. Your legend in the Cyber Wild West is just beginning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of cyberpunk aesthetics and western adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable levels with multiple item sets and evolving clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >360\u00b0 panoramic scenes alongside classic hidden object gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible rewards for mastering locations in various play modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204680/extras/90de8c0f8d1d5858fe3aef20cac5af81.avif?t=1756469429\" width=600 height=292 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Newbie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204680/c5e4dddc80e3aa7138f56cd9b24d316899f8e293.jpg"},{"name":"Winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204680/e28f61aa66322adb228f57a44806c164dd72b58d.jpg"},{"name":"Gentleman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco